        "TileImage": "$($repository e25c7c8b-88c0-4ab5-adeb-3583fadf4e6d).Image",
        "Description": "Complications have arisen. All of a sudden, every last bit of tech you have is encrypted by an outside force.\r\rThis is inconvinient. Especially for tracking down targets.\r\rThe ICA is trying to protect themselves.\r\rBreak into their secret facility in Chongqing, and leave a calculated message behind.\r\rTake out several important figures and regain control over your tech.\r\rRaiding their servers will also give you access to a wide array of contacts and intel.\r\rWe&apos;re just getting started.",
